# .exportignore — per-project export rules (see README.md).
#
# codepack exports itself, including in the CI acceptance step, so a rule that only
# matters for this repository's own export lives here rather than in a shared default.

# The root-level installer duplicate (audit 2026-09-07, D-1): a binary that has nothing
# to do with the source, and would otherwise add 10-20 MB to every self-export for no
# benefit.
setup.exe
